%% Proposed send/recovery contract; not implemented. 2026-11-18.
%%{init: {"theme":"neutral","themeVariables":{"fontFamily":"Arial, sans-serif","fontSize":"16px"},"sequence":{"messageMargin":30,"diagramMarginX":20}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Phone
    participant G as Remote gateway
    participant A as GPUI / RemoteHost
    participant S as Persistence
    participant R as ChatRuntime
    P->>G: POST run (epoch, key, expiry, If-Match)
    G->>G: Authenticate, deduplicate, enqueue
    G-->>P: 202 operation_id
    G->>A: Targeted command
    A->>A: Recheck grant, version, session busy
    A->>S: Persist user message
    A-->>G: Operation saving + run pending
    S-->>A: SaveReceipt success
    A->>R: Release launch barrier
    A-->>G: Operation succeeded + run_id
    G-->>P: SSE operation.changed
    R-->>A: Existing runtime events
    A-->>G: Merged state commits
    G-->>P: SSE message / run updates
    Note over P,R: Phone disconnect does not cancel the run
    P->>G: Reconnect with saved cursor
    alt Cursor retained
        G-->>P: Replay then live events
    else Replay gap or epoch changed
        G-->>P: Resync required
        P->>G: GET snapshot and operation
        G-->>P: Current state and new cursor
    end
